    "detail": {
      "id": 1350062,
      "name": "[Astra Yao] Crimson Beats",
      "desc": "With enough energy, releasing or following up with a <color=#FFFFFF>Tremolo</color> attack while in the <color=#FFFFFF>Idyllic Cadenza</color> state will <color=#2BAD00>additionally deal two instances</color> of identical <color=#FFFFFF>Tremolo</color> DMG. When Astra Yao hits enemies with <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Interlude</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Chorus</color>, there's a 20% chance to gain the <color=#FFFFFF>Inspiration</color> effect, allowing her next <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge</color> to <color=#2BAD00>directly trigger</color> <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color>, which can be followed up with <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Chorus</color>, lasting 30s.",
